# What gates/harness-conformance.sh needs to know of this harness (docs/adr/0041
# §8); exactly these four keys, read by ci/harness-shape.sh and the suite.
#
# MODEL is ADR 0040 §1's pair for the provider. KEY_VAR is the .env variable
# holding the key (.env.example names it). THINKING_PATH is the jq path into the
# request body where the thinking value must appear: the Gemini API's
# generationConfig.thinkingConfig.thinkingLevel, read in
# @google/gemini-cli@0.61.0-preview.0's bundle (generateContentParametersToMldev
# copies the config's thinkingConfig under generationConfig) on 2026-11-04.
PROVIDER=gemini
MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
KEY_VAR=GEMINI_API_KEY
THINKING_PATH=.generationConfig.thinkingConfig.thinkingLevel
